        "created_at": "2015-06-29T13:34:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>This is our first Sentinel Tactics tournament and we have some great prize support from Greater Than Games including cards and miniatures! This is a fun way to meet other SoM players. Additionally, if you were hoping to play at GenCon this will be great preparation for you!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Bring your game copy and be entered in a raffle!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>Start: 11AM</div><div>Entry: $5</div><div>Format: If we have four teams, Round Robin. If we have more we'll use Swiss. Sentinels tournaments are typically run in a 3 vs 3 format and we will do the same at the store.&nbsp;</div><div>Prize Support: Greater Than Games Tournament Kit.</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:56.756Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
